### Findings

#### CRITICAL · PRC102 · Another account reached A's object

`specs/shop.yaml:9:5` · `DELETE /orders/{id}`

**Why:** B deleted A's order.

**Fix:** Check the owner. [More about PRC102](https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC102.md)

**Proof:**

- `B: GET /orders/1 → 200` ``{"note": "`[x](https://evil.example)` <img src=x>"}``
- `B: DELETE /orders/1 → 204`
- `A: GET /orders/1 → 404` `{ "error": "no such order" }`

#### HIGH · PRC001 · Operation has no authentication

`specs/shop.yaml:9:5` · `` `GET /orders/ # [x](https://evil.example) ``

**Why:** Anyone can call it.

**Fix:** Add security. [More about PRC001](https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC001.md)

